# local env files
# `.env` too, not just `.env*.local`: EXPO_PUBLIC_* values are inlined into the bundle,
# and a real API key in a committed .env is a key in the repo. `.env.example` is the
# checked-in one.
.env
.env*.local

# typescript
*.tsbuildinfo

# generated native folders
/ios
/android
